OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FGuidance on use of toilets and
OL,8,Fchanging rooms as single-sex spaces
OL,9,Fcomes into force on Wednesday, almost
OL,10,Fa year-and-a-half after the landmark
OL,11,FSupreme Court ruling on biological sex.
OL,13,FDescribed as giving "up-to-date
OL,14,Fexamples of how the Equality Act
OL,15,Fapplies to everyday situations", it
OL,16,Fwill be something that can be relied
OL,17,Fon in court if there are legal
OL,18,Fchallenges.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FFurther challenges are expected, as
OL,8,FEqualities Minister Bridget Phillipson
OL,9,Fhas previously suggested is expected
OL,10,F"because this is a very contested
OL,11,Fspace".
OL,13,FWhile Britain's equalities regulator
OL,14,Fhas stressed that its updated code of
OL,15,Fpractice does not make new law or
OL,16,Fcreate new legal obligations, it
OL,17,Fprovides services such as cafes and
OL,18,Fleisure centres with legally accurate,
OL,19,Fimpartial and up-to-date guidance on
OL,20,Fexisting law.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FThe April 2025 Supreme Court ruling
OL,8,Fwas hailed by campaigners as a victory
OL,9,Fconfirming "women are women and men
OL,10,Fare men" ` although others called it
OL,11,F"incredibly worrying for the trans
OL,12,Fcommunity".
OL,14,FWhen the code, which covers England,
OL,15,FScotland and Wales, was published in
OL,16,Fdraft form in May ` having been
OL,17,Fupdated for the first time in more
OL,18,Fthan a decade ` Equality and Human
OL,19,FRights Commission (EHRC) chairwoman
OL,20,FMary-Ann Stephenson described it as a
OL,21,F"major milestone".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FThe code confirmed a service must be
OL,8,Fused on the basis of biological sex in
OL,9,Forder for it to be classed as single-
OL,10,Fsex under the Equality Act, as per the
OL,11,FSupreme Court ruling.
OL,13,FThis means single-sex toilets,
OL,14,Fchanging rooms, hospital wards and
OL,15,Frefuges must be used based on a
OL,16,Fperson's birth sex, not the gender
OL,17,Fwith which they identify.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FIt has been suggested unisex services
OL,8,Fsuch as self-contained lockable
OL,9,Fcubicles could ensure provision of
OL,10,Ftoilets and changing rooms for all,
OL,11,Fwith the code noting it would be "very
OL,12,Funlikely to be proportionate to put a
OL,13,Ftrans person in a position where there
OL,14,Fis no service that they are allowed to
OL,15,Fuse".
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FAnalysis suggests nearly 13,000
OL,8,Ftoilets and more than 5,000 changing
OL,9,Frooms could have to be revamped at
OL,10,Fgyms, hospitals and leisure centres
OL,11,Facross Britain at a cost of millions
OL,12,Fas a result of the guidance.
OL,14,FAt least 18,000 signs might also need
OL,15,Fto be changed, according to figures
OL,16,Ffrom a Freedom of Information request
OL,17,Fto the EHRC earlier this year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FPublic-sector bodies, such as local
OL,8,Fcouncils, are estimated to face
OL,9,Funadjusted costs for cleaning the new-
OL,10,Flook facilities totalling #20.6
OL,11,Fmillion, together with #14.2 million
OL,12,Fper year for building work ` though
OL,13,Fthese sums could rise even higher.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FIn the face of previous criticism for
OL,8,Fthe delay in publishing the code, the
OL,9,Fgovernment had repeatedly insisted it
OL,10,Fwas "taking the time to get this
OL,11,Fright" and has suggested "many
OL,12,Fbusinesses will already be largely
OL,13,Fcompliant with the code so there will
OL,14,Fbe no cost at all".
OL,16,FThe updated guidance affects service
OL,17,Fproviders such as restaurants, leisure
OL,18,Fcentres and hairdressers; public
OL,19,Ffunctions such as council services;
OL,20,Fand associations such as local sports
OL,21,Fclubs with at least 25 members.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FAppearing before the Women and
OL,8,FEqualities committee in June,
OL,9,FPhillipson ` who has since lost her
OL,10,Fprevious post as Education Secretary
OL,11,Funder Andy Burnham's new premiership
OL,12,Fbut kept her equalities role ` said it
OL,13,Fis her expectation that "because this
OL,14,Fis a very contested space, there will
OL,15,Fcontinue to be further debate,
OL,16,Fchallenge, scrutiny, legal challenge".
OL,18,FShe told MPs at the time: "That would
OL,19,Fbe the case, whatever the draft code
OL,20,Fsaid."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FAsked if she was worried about the
OL,8,Ffinancial and more general impact of
OL,9,Flegal challenges and "lawfare" on
OL,10,Forganisations, she said while she
OL,11,Funderstands some, particularly smaller
OL,12,Fones without access to big budgets,
OL,13,Fmight find this area "difficult", she
OL,14,Fbelieves the code "provides for what
OL,15,Fis needed across the protected
OL,16,Fcharacteristics".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,FFormer Home Secretary Suella
OL,8,FBraverman, who is now Reform UK's
OL,9,Fequalities spokeswoman, said the
OL,10,Fgovernment had been "dragged kicking
OL,11,Fand screaming into adopting simple
OL,12,Fcommon sense and protecting women's-
OL,13,Fonly spaces".
OL,15,FShe added: "The government and EHRC
OL,16,Fnow have no excuse in not enforcing
OL,17,Fand upholding the law.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785946756
OL,3,CSingle-sex spaces code comes in force
OL,4,Cmore than year after Supreme Court
OL,5,Cruling
OL,7,F"That means getting tough with civil
OL,8,Fservants and public sector bodies who
OL,9,Fcontinue to buy into nonsensical woke
OL,10,Fdefinitions of gender and threaten the
OL,11,Frights and privacy of British women
OL,12,Fand girls."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
